## LLM Preference for Project Work

When a project being built needs an LLM call (summarization, classification, generation, embedding, chat, or any inference task), load the `me` skill and prefer the user's own endpoints there before suggesting paid APIs like OpenAI, Anthropic, or any cloud provider.
